        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
          <segments>WrittenDataMinimumSize</segments>
        </dataPath>
        <toolTip>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>The minimum size of data that can be written to the storage. Must be at least 2048 bytes.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>حداقل اندازه داده‌ای که می‌توان در ذخیره‌ساز نوشت. باید حداقل 2048 بایت باشد.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Настройка ограничивает размер данных, которые попадают в хранилище при записи. Вводимое значение должно быть не меньше 2048 байт.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Ayar, kayıt sırasında depoya giren veri boyutunu kısıtlar. Girilen değer 2048 bayttan az olmamalıdır.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>The minimum size of data that can be written to the storage. Must be at least 2048 bytes.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>The minimum size of data that can be written to the storage. Must be at least 2048 bytes.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>The minimum size of data that can be written to the storage. Must be at least 2048 bytes.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <handlers>
